    {
      "block_id": "h2-10",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "What CI Should Do Now vs What Validate Should Own Later",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard",
        "initially_visible": true
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "h3-11",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": "CI owns now (before validate tool exists):",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard",
        "initially_visible": true
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-12",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "1. Orchestrate pre-commit hooks (ruff, pyright, typos, formatting) 2. Run focused test files as separate CI jobs 3. Run validation scripts as CI steps 4. Enforce path-based gating via `paths:` filters 5. Run full pytest suite as promotion gate 6. Build and publish artifacts 7. Check uv lock consistency",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "h3-13",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": "Validate should own later (after validate tool is implemented):",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard",
        "initially_visible": true
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-14",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "1. Define check commands and profiles in a registry (not in CI YAML) 2. Run the same checks locally and in CI 3. Emit content-light receipts for each check 4. Classify blockers (test_failure, lint_failure, schema_failure, etc.) 5. Support `--check-only` (CI mode) and `--fix` (local mode) variants 6. Consolidate duplicate check commands across scripts",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "h3-15",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": "Migration Path",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard",
        "initially_visible": true
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "code-16",
      "type": "code",
      "language": "text",
      "content": "Stage 0-1 (today):             CI YAML defines all commands directly\nStage 2 (CI refactor):         CI YAML calls validate profiles\nStage 3 (validate maturity):   validate tool has profile registry, CI is thin wrapper",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "detailed",
        "collapsible": true,
        "collapsed_by_default": true
      }
    },
